@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms and Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <h1 class="text-center mb-4">Client Guidelines, Policies & Privacy Statement</h1>
    <p class="text-muted text-center">Le’Ray Aesthetic and Wellness Center</p>

    <hr />

    <h3>1. Appointment Policy</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Accurate Information:</strong> Clients must provide accurate and complete information during booking.</li>
        <li><strong>Punctuality:</strong> Clients are given a 15-minute grace period. Arriving beyond this window without notice will be considered a no-show, which may result in cancellation and forfeiture of any payment or downpayment made.</li>
        <li><strong>No-Show Policy:</strong> Repeated no-shows may lead to booking restrictions.</li>
        <li><strong>Booking Confirmation:</strong> Appointments are confirmed only upon receipt of required contact details and downpayment.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2. Payment Policy</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Accepted Methods:</strong> Payments may be made via GCash, PayMaya, or bank transfer.</li>
        <li><strong>Payment Confirmation:</strong> A screenshot of your payment is required as proof for booking.</li>
        <li><strong>Official Receipts:</strong> All transactions will be issued a BIR-registered Official Receipt in compliance with BIR RR No. 10-2015.</li>
        <li><strong>Downpayments:</strong> A 20% downpayment is required to secure your appointment. This is non-refundable unless otherwise specified.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>3. Cancellation, Refund & Non-Cancellation Policy</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Cancellation Notice:</strong> Cancellations must be made in writing via email at least 24–48 hours in advance.</li>
        <li><strong>Refund Eligibility:</strong>
            <ul>
                <li>Refunds are processed within 5–7 business days.</li>
                <li>Refunds are subject to review and approval.</li>
                <li>Services marked as non-refundable are not eligible under any condition.</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Non-Cancellation Clause:</strong> Once an appointment is confirmed and a downpayment is made, the client acknowledges that cancellations beyond the allowed notice period are strictly non-refundable and non-transferable. This policy ensures fairness to both clients and staff scheduling.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>4. Data Privacy – RA 10173 (Data Privacy Act of 2012)</h3>
    <p>This law protects your personal information and ensures your data is handled responsibly.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Protects individual personal information in information and communications systems.</li>
        <li><strong>Consent:</strong> Client consent is required before collecting any personal data.</li>
        <li><strong>Security:</strong> Le’Ray implements data security measures to protect personal information against unauthorized access.</li>
        <li><strong>Privacy Notice:</strong> All client data is used solely for appointment, billing, and record purposes and will not be shared without consent.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>5. Consumer Protection – RA 7394</h3>
    <p>We adhere to fair trade practices and respect the rights of all consumers.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Clear Terms:</strong> All transactions, refund, and cancellation policies are disclosed to clients.</li>
        <li><strong>Non-Refundable Items:</strong> Certain treatments, once initiated, cannot be refunded.</li>
        <li><strong>Complaint Handling:</strong> Le’Ray ensures all client concerns and refund requests are addressed promptly and fairly.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>6. BIR E-Invoicing – RR No. 10-2015</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Establishes rules for issuing electronic receipts or sales invoices.</li>
        <li><strong>Official Receipts:</strong> A BIR-registered Official Receipt (OR) is issued for every transaction.</li>
        <li><strong>Payment Proof:</strong> Screenshots of payments are accepted for validation but do not replace the official receipt.</li>
    </ul>

    <hr />

    <h3>7. Agreement</h3>
    <p>
        By booking an appointment or availing any service from Le’Ray Aesthetic and Wellness Center,
        you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to abide by all the policies stated above.
    </p>

    <div class="text-center mt-4">
        <a href="/Home/Index" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
</div>
